{
  "id": "1KI.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Sugoodiga 10",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bareanyeeka gatmooda was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Sheba.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gatmooda was sugoocheanda bea ng'eanyiida Sheba, iidu nea ghwayiiy baruureega Sulemani bea gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA, ghoan gwasim aba ng'asheega hang'oonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahidu Yerusalemu nea goodeana fuga saang'a, ea ngamiyajeega sareeni dabita, ea dahaabu, ea lagheanga mideawa sheayeeda haw; hean nea ghwahidu heeda Sulemani, gwarukusa gilinyoo gwanda uhuudaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha Sulemani ghuuta ng'asheega sean; nea manda gil funyaat aba heeda sugoocheanda jea ea marukusiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iinea ghwadaah gatmooda was sugoocheanda bea ng'eanyiida Sheba weaghuumeeda uhuuda Sulemani, ea gheeda nideas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea hamiteaba gheanyi, ea giibinda fugaaschi hees, ea gidagadiyeata fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, ea giikwealshooda nyaawa, ea fuga ang'oonyi gikoombeeydaanyi, ea lukghumajeega sigwariida adayda aba gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, hean goosha guroorooda aba jeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Iita eayiing'si jeeda ng'eanyiideanya huumwa gil bea gidiibiideati ea weaghuumeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mwaamwasi bwak ea doan ak ghaadaayi aba gheanyangeasu; ak ging'ulayi, gisirukuneani eara bugusta gidamughuush mwahita; weaghuumeadaang'u ea baruureagaagu gaburdeawa iita sirukunean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaba hooseaneega gadeemgaagu! Gaba hooseaneega fiisu ikaagu bea gadiyeedean, miineadayi galeagasean aba madeadaang'u, nea gooleeyiisa iita weaghuumeadaang'u! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa eakghaambiit NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, niloanyi ak ghamiindaneey aba uhuuda hoorgeeda eemeeda Israeli! Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ghabwariiy eemeeda Israeli damanda manda muudeanooda, nea ea niighaambiinyi wasa sugoocheanda, ak hean gimiineadaysi huumeanda ea doobiiwnata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw sugoocheanda dalaantaji bughala ea diktam bea dahaabu, ea haleanjeeda saang'a, ea lagheanga haw sheayeat; hean ea mudu gwanda haleanjeeda deena suh adaw gatmooda was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Sheba heeda sugoocheanda was Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata maleambooda Hiramu, eana dahaabu Ofiri, gweana Ofiri mooneeda saang'a bea geediga ea lagheanga haw sheayeat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin sugoocheanda geedigiga ghoah ng'udanga jea gwadiinya gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gheeda sugoocheanda, ea gidoondooriida ea gureayeeka fuga sarmani; manda geediga sigala giika ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghoadaw gatmooda was sugoocheanda bea Sheba gilinyoo gagasa, gilinyoo gamus, ghoah gida adaw gheambalmeeda sugoocheanda Sulemani. Hean ghang'eat gawa, gabiikta ng'eanyiidaanyi sea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baruureega Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mooneeda dahaabooda siyeadu heeda Sulemani aba jeemba gwanyagi gaba dalaantaji bughalaji lah ea laadam ea lah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "siihaada gea leabu heeda fuga ageakshachi, ea heeda fuga sheaha haleanjeeda, ea heeda sugoodiga Arabiya ea heeda sugoodiga hees ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin sugoocheanda was Sulemani igeambooni bughalaji iyeenya sisna dahaabu; bughalaji lah bea shekeelajeega dahaabu gaweay jeemba gilinyoo ea igeambooda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin igeambooni bughalaji samwagu sisna dahaabooda sing'aal, ea haleanji samwagu uurji dahaabu weah jeemba gil was igeambooda; ak ghwayiin sugoocheanda jeeda gheeda dareabeeta Lebanoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin gicha sugoocheanda hoorgeeda haw bea gujaka beeshaka, ak ghwayeasha dahaabooda miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea hoorgeeda gaba gidingeayooji lah, badayda hoorgeeda gwanda uhuuda meayda, ak murdajeega hoorgeeda gwanda heeda sidiiwa geatinga, nea gwanda ng'anyeew iyeenya miinaada aba murdeeda heeda sidiiwa geatinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak hean ng'anyeew damaniyeenya, ghamiinaada aba hoowa, ak gaba nih miinaada aba gidingeanda, aba heeda gidingeayooji lah. Ak ea manda gisisin aba jeemba sugoocheanduumeeda wassean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabita sean sileehiida bea sugoocheanda was Sulemani geesina dahaabu eara dabita gheeda jeeda dareabeeta Lebanoni gaba dahaabooda miyaas; nea ea manda gea sisna lapiya, meanung' ghoah gil aba damanyoojiga Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sugoocheanda gwandeawa maleambajeega ng'ucheeda aba ng'eanyiida Darshishi aba jeeda basooda ea maleambajeega ng'ucheeda bea Hiramu. Nibwagi aba jeemba gweanyeew samwagu maleambajeega ng'ucheeda bea Darshishi inyeesa ghapka gweadu dahaabu, ea lapiya, ea gujaka beeshaka, ea ghandajeega, ea ghariibajeanda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghwanaawa sugoodiga suurja aba jeeda ng'eanyiida aba baruureega ea weaghuumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagaseada eemeeda sean bea ng'eanyiida heeda mida Sulemani gooleeysiit weaghuumeadaanyi, ghayi adaw ASEETA ak hean ghwayiin jeeda fughareadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaba siisi eadu gida geatinda, haleanjeeda sisna lapiya, ea dahaabu, ea hang'weaka, ea dabita ng'ucheeda, ea deanguurga, ea faraasajeega, ea nghatka, hean gweatu gilakweayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwada geat Sulemani Mutukwajeega faraasajeega ea fuga manmani faraasajeega; niny gaba mutukwaji sagalama ea bughalaji ang'wan ea fuga manmani faraasajeega ghwahita sagalamnyooji damaniyeenya, ak ghwayiin jeeda mujiinajeega mutukwajeega sea sugoocheanda aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin sugoocheanda lapiya aba Yerusalemu gawuurji lagheanga, ng'ata gwasin gubooyeeka ghoah meaghayga mida Shefula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sulemani faraasajeega mideawa gwaleabu Misri ea Gue, ea fuga ageakshi bea sugoocheanda ghwanyasa shaah aba Gue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutuku inyeesa geesheayna Misri aba lapiyaji bughalaji lah, ak faraasi geashaaha bughalajeanda ea haradam ea muut; ak hean aba heeda fuga ageakshachi bea sugoocheanda ghwashaayda aba heeda sugoodiga ng'eanyiida fuga Hiti ea sugoodiga ng'eanyiida Shaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
